962), ‘모나코의 행복과 사랑’(1962), ‘황야의 3상사’(1964) 등이다. 한 해 2편이 개봉할 때도 있을 정도로 시나트라는 한국 관객에게 친숙했다.","date":"2026-05-13T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/05/14/VALATR2KHRCWFLAVRSYFE637RE/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"좋은 글을 쓰고 싶다면… 30초 안에 메모하세요","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-13T18:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/premium/2026/05/07/227APQ27TJBUVNCUGVEGGVIVHU/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"전국 두부 맛집 기행: 이천에서 마포까지 ‘콩’에 진심인 식당들","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-13T18:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/food-taste/2026/05/14/K6WDWQ2A5FC4BJJWNX2VIMHIX4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"이이경, 1인 법인 세무조사로 추징금… “고의 누락·탈루 아냐”","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-13T15:15:53.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/k-culture/2026/05/14/KIVKAK6UDRHZVARVE3AAF6BOHY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[일사일언] 짜증과 속도의 상관관계","partialText":"","date":"2026-05-13T15:42:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/05/14/UZCLSQMKGREX5ISTKNV376C7SM/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categ